%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'sequence': {'boxMargin': 10, 'messageMargin': 40, 'noteMargin': 15, 'bottomMarginAdj': 15}} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as nginx :8080
    participant S as backend :9000
    participant C as confirmations :9001

    B->>N: GET /
    N-->>B: static/index.html

    rect rgb(234, 245, 244)
    Note over B,N: Phase 1 — synchronous
    B->>N: POST /api/submit  { json }
    N->>S: proxy_pass POST /submit
    S-->>N: 200 { "status": "received" }
    N-->>B: 200 { "status": "received" }
    end

    par open SSE stream
        B->>N: GET /confirmations (keeps connection open)
        N->>C: proxy_pass GET /confirmations (keeps connection open)
        activate C
    and background job in backend
        Note right of S: goroutine sleeps 5s
    end

    Note over S,C: Phase 2 — write result into stream
    S->>N: POST /confirmations { "status": "applied" }
    N->>C: proxy_pass POST /confirmations
    C-->>N: data: { "status": "applied" }
    deactivate C
    N-->>B: data: { "status": "applied" }
